></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hZDzol kRuHOG pf-259_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-260_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-261_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-264_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-265_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-267_">2019</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-268_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-269_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-272_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-273_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-275_">Penta restructures<span style="font-weight: normal;">, welcoming new regional directors and after-sales specialists. </span>Penta Klerksdorp<span style="font-weight: normal;"> makes headlines </span>selling one out of seven cars<span style="font-weight: normal;"> in their municipal district!</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hZDzol kRuHOG pf-276_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-277_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-278_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-281_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-282_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-284_">2020</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-285_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-286_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-289_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-290_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-292_"><span style="font-weight: normal;">Covid-19 changes the course of history. During the lockdown, our in-house marketing team creates fresh, innovative ways that address mobility. We're excited for the future, lining up new projects to be launched. </span>Penta welcomes our North West branch: Hyundai Brits<span style="font-weight: normal;">.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hZDzol kRuHOG pf-293_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-294_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-295_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-298_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-299_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-301_">2021</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-302_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-303_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-306_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-307_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-309_">Penta ventures into the fleet and rental market<span style="font-weight: 400;">,</span> launching Drive<span style="font-weight: 400;"> and </span>Penta Fleet Solutions<span style="font-weight: 400;">. This year also holds some excitement with the </span>opening of our Chery floor <span style="font-weight: normal;">at</span> Penta Menlyn<span style="font-weight: 400;">. In addition, PMG officially </span><span style="font-weight: normal;">won</span> Suzuki's volume dealer of the year award 2020<span style="font-weight: 400;"> with </span>Suzuki Rustenburg<span style="font-weight: 400;"> being the overall dealer of the year.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hZDzol kRuHOG pf-310_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-311_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-312_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-315_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-316_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-318_">2022</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-319_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-320_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-323_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-324_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-326_"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Penta opens the <strong>PMG fitment centre</strong>, providing vehicle customisations to meet the unique needs of our clients. Additionally, we opened the doors to the <strong>Suzuki Experience Store</strong> in <strong>Menlyn Park Shopping Centre</strong>, allowing us to make it easier for our customers to access our products.<br></span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hZDzol kRuHOG pf-327_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-328_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-329_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-332_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-333_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-335_">2023</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-336_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-337_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-340_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-341_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-343_"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Penta adds another brand to our portfolio with <strong>Omoda</strong>, the luxury sub-brand of Chery. We also introduced the <strong>Jimny Crew</strong>, an organisation sharing appreciation for the Suzuki Jimny. In addition, Suzuki footprint grows with the <strong>opening of two new branches</strong> in <strong>Brits and Potchefstroom</strong>.<br></span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-hZDzol kRuHOG pf-344_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-345_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-346_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-349_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-350_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-352_">2024</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-353_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bkENKe dkwUhI pf-354_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hGMjVM cQDYcy pf-357_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hYmYN cpglDO pf-358_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-laNFUy ymAQo pf-360_"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Jaecoo joins Omoda and we <strong>launch the first official Omoda | Jaecoo dealership</strong> in the country. 

To increase our footprint <strong>Penta Now kicks off</strong> with 7 dealerships in 3 provinces focussing on quality used vehicles.
